README.md:9:Backend failures rarely identify their own cause. A loud log may be secondary, a valid configuration value may lose to precedence, and a runtime value may differ from its TypeScript assertion. TraceRoot evaluates whether controlled investigation and reproduction improve root-cause identification over a fair one-shot comparison.
